665697154,2026-10-03 10:51:56,manett82,2023-08-13,26,2,,$CRWV Jeffries just stated that most long term contracts were based on about 12million per megawatt for all big players...and we now know that pricing is at 40millikon or more ...think about that...this is massive ..these margins are the same reason the same premise why micron and nividia are going wild chips tock prices have tripled and here compute prices have MORE than tripled . They stated as of the last call that their newest backlog of 29 billion is at new pricing . Even though infrastructure costs have gone up somewhat compute prices are up far far more. Musk is projecting levels as high as 50 for years now with the massive gw delay for oracle pricing could go even higher THIS COULD END UP 4X-5X think about Musk pricing..30-50 ...when coreweave reaches 8gws that could mean 240-400 billion in revenue with very healthy margins
